  "summary": "字符串引力是其中不同字符数，求所有非空子串引力之和。",
  "insight": "扫描右端点 i，维护所有以 i 结尾子串的引力总和 current。字符 ch 上次在 last 出现，则新加入 ch 给起点在 last+1..i 的子串各增加一，共 i-last；累加 current 到答案。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "贡献按上次出现位置计算",
    "last 初始负一",
    "答案使用 long"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "last-occurrence-ending-substring-contribution",
      "title": "上次出现与结尾子串贡献",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "在线维护每个右端点所有子串的不同字符总数。",
      "steps": [
        "last[26] 初始化 -1，current=answer=0",
        "i 扫描：current+=i-last[ch]，更新 last[ch]=i",
        "answer+=current；返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(alphabet)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/last-occurrence-ending-substring-contribution/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/last-occurrence-ending-substring-contribution/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/last-occurrence-ending-substring-contribution/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
